``` ### 4. MODAL / OVERLAY SYSTEM ```css .overlay-backdrop {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    z-index: var(--z-modal-backdrop);
